WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.915
[DISTINGUISHED MUSIC]

00:00:00.915 --> 00:00:01.715
Hello.

00:00:01.715 --> 00:00:04.470
Reboots are symptomatic
of a fundamental lack

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:06.140
of originality in Hollywood.

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.490
Have you no shame?

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.890
Here's your check for
the Animaniacs reboot,

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:12.856
you sellouts.

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:14.029
[CRASH]

00:00:14.029 --> 00:00:14.962
[MUSIC - "ANIMANIACS" THEME]

00:00:14.962 --> 00:00:18.300
(SINGING) It's time
for Animaniacs.

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.970
You should see
our new contracts.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.620
All right guys, there's a lot
of pressure on our first lines.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.420
Did we--

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.350
Wait-- don't!

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.365
Make sure it's good first.

00:00:26.365 --> 00:00:27.165
[INHALE]

00:00:27.165 --> 00:00:28.830
Maybe something reminiscent
of the first season?

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.180
[GROWL]

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.225
[BAM]

00:00:31.225 --> 00:00:33.880
22 years later, and
I'm still a knockout.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:35.385
[THUNDER]

00:00:35.385 --> 00:00:38.570
I've tried online dating but
I keep getting catfished.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.420
How do I know she's even real?

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.300
[BWAP]

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:43.240
[MUSIC]

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:46.975
This tablet contains the
sum of all human knowledge.

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:50.590
All human knowledge in one
easy to swallow tablet?

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:51.390
[GULP]

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:52.190
[CRASH]

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:53.360
[ELECTROCUTION]

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.750
Quantum mechanics,
quinoa wraps, Queen Bey.

00:00:56.750 --> 00:00:58.190
We've missed so much.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.190
[MUSIC - "ANIMANIACS" THEME]

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:00.990
Oh!

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.025
Sounds like an Odyssey.

00:01:04.954 --> 00:01:05.900
My sandwich!

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:06.814
[FLY BUZZ]

00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:08.642
[WHOOSH]

00:01:08.642 --> 00:01:10.470
[LASERS BUZZ]

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:11.810
[BOINK]

00:01:11.810 --> 00:01:13.100
Just where I left it.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.870
[MUSIC - "ANIMANIACS" THEME]

00:01:14.870 --> 00:01:16.372
Yakko, turn on the blacklight.

00:01:16.372 --> 00:01:17.172
[CLICK]

00:01:17.172 --> 00:01:18.465
[RAVE MUSIC]

00:01:18.465 --> 00:01:19.510
[CLICK]

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:20.560
Nothing unusual there.

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.255
[MUSIC - "ANIMANIACS" THEME]

00:01:22.255 --> 00:01:24.057
Gee, Brain, what do
you want to do tonight?

00:01:24.057 --> 00:01:26.480
The same thing we do
every night, Pinky.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:28.050
Try to take over the wor--

00:01:28.050 --> 00:01:29.285
[FOAM]

00:01:29.285 --> 00:01:30.085
Wee!

00:01:30.085 --> 00:01:31.014
Foam party!

00:01:31.014 --> 00:01:33.978
[MUSIC]

00:01:33.978 --> 00:01:35.180
[CHIMES]

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:37.370
I am the Pegasus.

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:39.473
I come bearing horrible
tidings of war from the--

00:01:39.473 --> 00:01:40.273
[HONK]

00:01:40.273 --> 00:01:41.073
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:41.073 --> 00:01:42.140
Less talk-y more flap-y.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.250
[CHIMES]

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.996
Woo hoo!

00:01:44.996 --> 00:01:45.948
[ZING]

00:01:45.948 --> 00:01:47.852
[BOINGING]

00:01:47.852 --> 00:01:48.804
[ZAP]

00:01:48.804 --> 00:01:49.996
[CRASH]

00:01:49.996 --> 00:01:50.796
[BOOM]

00:01:50.796 --> 00:01:53.605
(SINGING) We're Animan-y,
totally insane-y,

00:01:53.605 --> 00:01:55.489
Never mansplain-y.

00:01:55.489 --> 00:01:58.275
Animaniacs!

00:01:58.275 --> 00:01:59.816
Now the adoration pours in.

00:01:59.816 --> 00:02:00.616
[DING]

00:02:00.616 --> 00:02:01.608
[CHIME]

00:02:01.608 --> 00:02:02.600
[BOING]

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.750
[BWAP]

00:02:03.750 --> 00:02:04.800
Narf!

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.200
[MUSIC - "ANIMANIACS" THEME]

